  "texts": {
    "preamble": "An Application For Bail Under Section ... vs In Re:- Oriya Rabi @ Rabi Singh on 12 April, 2016",
    "facts": "Charge sheet has been submitted. It is the case of the prosecution that without any license the petitioner was running a country liquor shop and by consuming poisonous country liquor purchased from his shop, two persons died and several persons became seriously ill. Our attention has been drawn by the learned Public Prosecutor, High Court, Calcutta to the statements of the local people, which are at pages 8, 9, 13 and 14 of the case diary. Going through the same, we find the petitioner's, prima facie, complicity is very much there. An Application For Bail Under Section ... vs In Re:- Oriya Rabi @ Rabi Singh on 12 April, 2016 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/125587237/ 1 Having regard to above, this application for bail is rejected.",
